Reading it: a large gap between one seed and 'any seed right' means
the native well is in reach and the single-shot number is a sampling
artefact. A large gap between one seed and the modal well means that
artefact is recoverable for free, since voting needs no energy
function. If unanimity separates right from wrong, the rule has a
usable confidence estimate it is not currently being asked for.

